    {
      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "TIMING",
      "narration_text": "Your brain finds a sound with two ears. A sound on your right reaches your right ear first. In my head model, straight out to one side, the gap is about two thirds of a millisecond, and it shrinks to nothing as the sound moves in front of you.",
