    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "FRONT OR BACK",
      "narration_text": "But a sound in front of you and its mirror behind you give your ears the same timing and the same loudness. In my model, exactly the same. Your outer ears break the tie: their folds change the high notes depending on where a sound comes from.",
