    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "THE FILTERS",
      "narration_text": "Researchers measure all of this with microphones inside a dummy head's ears, from more than seven hundred directions. Those measurements are called head-related transfer functions. Run a sound through the pair for one direction, and headphones play it from there. Put your headphones on, and listen.",
