      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "HEAD TRACKING",
      "narration_text": "Then there's head tracking. Turn your head, and an ordinary headphone mix turns with you. Spatial audio uses motion sensors to turn the sound the other way, so it stays put in the room. Apple added this to AirPods in twenty twenty.",
